# Klondike through the mouse. The test build starts at deal #5; deal
# number 1 is typed in (Alt + D); a simple player's moves (drags, double
# clicks, deals); undo and redo by keys; the menus by the mouse: geos/
# about, options/auto-drop, options/draw 3 (the same deal dealt again by
# threes), game/statistics, game/choose game (Spider, 1 suit) and a deal
# number, geos/Calculator (the gate puts Veranda's calculator in the
# system folder; the test build queues a 'q' that closes it); snapshots
# of the state along the way
game 0 5
dealno 1
auto 10
shot drag
auto 14
state
undo
state
redo
undo
undo
state
menu 0 0
shotnow about
ok
menu 3 0
auto 6
state
menu 3 2
state
auto 8
state
menu 1 4
shotnow stats
ok
choose 2
dealno 7
auto 12
state
menu 0 1
state
menu 2 0
state
end 60
